# The Tunh Xenohole

id:world-the-tunh-xenohole a oa:Place, oa:World ;
    skos:prefLabel "The Tunh Xenohole" ;
    oa:article <https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-article/491418776bb70> ;
    oa:kind "system" ;
    oa:labelsSystem false ;
    oa:note "A T1 brown dwarf, Neb 34786, with the planet Gatto and a wormhole mouth 601 AU out — 7.8 km across in the current era. Its far mouth is 3,309 ly from Sol in Sagittarius, which this map has no way to draw: a wormhole is two places and one object, and nothing here joins them. The near mouth is what is drawn, and the coordinates fall in Scorpius as the article says." ;
    oa:uncertain false .

